<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Crean sells stake in United Beverages.</title>
<headline>Crean sells stake in United Beverages.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>James Crean Plc said on Wednesday that it had sold its 27.8 percent shareholding in United Beverages Holdings Ltd to Guinness Ireland Group for a consideration of 12.94 million Irish pounds.  </p>
<p>Fyffes Plc also said it had sold its 18.5 percent stake in UBH, which is engaged in the wholesale distribution and manufacturing of soft drinks and other beverages, to Guinness Ireland for 8.62 million Irish pounds.</p>
</text>
